<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>HTML - 标签 - DebugTalk</title><link>https://debugtalk.com/tags/HTML/</link><description>DebugTalk</description><generator>Hugo 0.167.0 &amp; FixIt v1.0.0-beta-mukxzari</generator><language>zh-CN</language><managingEditor>mail@debugtalk.com (debugtalk)</managingEditor><webMaster>mail@debugtalk.com (debugtalk)</webMaster><lastBuildDate>Tue, 06 Oct 2026 11:47:32 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://debugtalk.com/tags/HTML/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>HTML 字符实体(Character Entity)</title><link>https://debugtalk.com/post/html-character-entity/</link><pubDate>Fri, 04 Oct 2013 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>mail@debugtalk.com (debugtalk)</author><guid>https://debugtalk.com/post/html-character-entity/</guid><category domain="https://debugtalk.com/categories/Development/">Development</category><description>&lt;h2 class="heading-element" id="字符实体的由来"&gt;&lt;span&gt;字符实体的由来&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;a href="#%e5%ad%97%e7%ac%a6%e5%ae%9e%e4%bd%93%e7%9a%84%e7%94%b1%e6%9d%a5" class="heading-mark"&gt;&lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;在HTML源文件中，有些字符（如&amp;lt;，&amp;gt;，&amp;amp;等）作为特殊字符不能直接使用，如果直接使用的话HTML将不能被正确解析。但如果HTML内容中需要展示这些特殊字符时该怎么处理呢？这就需要使用转义字符串